              "line1": "<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"><a><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Celebrating</span>&nbsp;</a>Hispanic Heritage</span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"> –</span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"> driving our mission forward</span></span>",
